Title: Naukrani Ki Haveli (Hinglish format test, written for this repo)

EPISODE 1

INT. SHARMA HAVELI - RAAT

Engagement party. Mehmaan champagne utha rahe hain. MEERA, ghar ki naukrani, tray leke aati hai.

RIYA
(taunting)
Dhyaan se, Meera. Ye tray tumse zyada mehenga hai.

Riya apna wine glass Meera ki uniform par ulat deti hai. Sab hanste hain.

MEERA
(dheere se)
Main aapke liye doosra glass le aati hoon, Riya ji.

RIYA
(gusse mein)
Kuch nahi laogi. Aaj raat ke baad tum is ghar mein nahi rahogi.

Darwaza khulta hai. VAKEEL SAHAB file leke andar aate hain.

VAKEEL SAHAB
Sharma ji ki vasiyat ke mutabik, ye haveli unki beti ke naam hai. Meera ke naam.

Meera ke haath se tray gir jaata hai. Sannata.

RIYA
(cheekhte hue)
Ye jhooth hai! Ek naukrani meri haveli nahi le sakti!
